Republican opposition to fully funding WIC puts the health & wellness of 6 MILLION pregnant mothers, new moms, & their children at risk.
 
@HouseDemocrats will continue the fight to fully fund WIC. 
 
House Republicans need to end the political stunts & put the needs of the American people over politics.

House Republicans radically cut funding in the #FarmBill for critical nutrition programs that millions of Americans rely on to feed their families.

SNAP benefits help almost 2 million low-income CA families put food on the table.

@HouseDemocrats are focused on reducing the burdens on families, Republicans don’t seem to care. #PeopleOverPolitics
